1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,806
One patient. Three enquiries. Three rows in your lead sheet.

2
00:00:04,256 --> 00:00:10,656
A plain exact match misses them. Capital letters, stray spaces, and one phone number written three ways.

3
00:00:11,106 --> 00:00:16,823
So the first step in n8n cleans the contact. Email in lowercase, phone in one format.

4
00:00:17,273 --> 00:00:19,748
Then it searches the lead list by email or phone.

5
00:00:20,198 --> 00:00:25,105
Already a lead? The new message is added to that lead. If not, a new lead is created.

6
00:00:25,555 --> 00:00:31,357
Real result: four enquiries in, two leads out. Match on email or phone, never on name alone.

7
00:00:31,807 --> 00:00:36,906
Follow for the next real n8n build, or DM FLOW for the free enquiry workflow.

